# Agent collaboration notes

- Before making code or documentation changes, write a short plan for the intended change.
- After each completed modification batch, run the relevant lightweight validation.
- Commit and push every completed modification batch to the current working branch.
- Do not run 4096-scale final jobs unless the user explicitly asks for them.
- Prefer small single-variable 2048 tests for DOE tuning decisions.
- Use derivative-based side-lobe metrics for conclusions; treat outside_max as a diagnostic only.
